This is version 0.7 (nearly) of KPoker a not that simple poker clone for the K Desktop Environment <http://www.kde.org>.

This version is considered to be very unstable. Please take a look at the file ChangeLog to see what was changed recently.

Have fun with the game and report any problems / bugs suggestions.


